# TLC model-checker scratch. scripts/check-spec.sh runs `tlc2.TLC` with its cwd
# set to docs/spec/, so TLC writes its metadir to docs/spec/states/<timestamp>/.
# `-cleanup` removes it only when the run COMPLETES; an interrupted or killed run
# leaves it behind, which is how 69 files (65 .st, 2 .fp and the nodes_0/ptrs_0
# disk graph — 4.2 MB) came to be committed. They are deleted in this branch, and
# this rule is what keeps the next local spec run from putting them back.
docs/spec/states/
